<title>JAPAN: Yamada corrects 96/97 group current profit.</title>
<headline>Yamada corrects 96/97 group current profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamada Corp on Monday corrected its group current profit for the year to March 31, 1997, to 683 million yen, instead of 763 million yen it announced on June 10.</p>
<p>Yamada makes automobile maintenance equipment and tools.</p>
